# Unit16
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit16核心词汇

skeptical/ˈskeptɪkl/怀疑的/He is skeptical about the new policy.
skip/skɪp/跳过/You can skip the introduction and go directly to the main text.
slight/slaɪt/轻微的/There is a slight difference between the two.
slope/sloʊp/斜坡/The car climbed the steep slope.
soar/sɔːr/飙升/Prices have soared in recent months.
sole/soʊl/唯一的/She is the sole survivor of the accident.
solemn/ˈsɑːləm/庄严的/He made a solemn promise.
sophisticated/səˈfɪstɪkeɪtɪd/复杂的；精密的/This is a sophisticated piece of equipment.
source/sɔːrs/来源/What is the source of this information?
specific/spəˈsɪfɪk/具体的/Please give me more specific details.
speculate/ˈspekjuleɪt/推测/Scientists speculate about the origin of the universe.
sphere/sfɪr/领域；球体/She works in the sphere of education.
spiritual/ˈspɪrɪtʃuəl/精神的/She has a strong spiritual life.
stable/ˈsteɪbl/稳定的/The country has a stable economy.
staff/stæf/全体职员/The company has a staff of 200.
stage/steɪdʒ/阶段；舞台/The project is in its final stage.
standard/ˈstændərd/标准/Our products meet international standards.
state/steɪt/状态；声明/The president made a state visit to China.
statistic/stəˈtɪstɪk/统计/The statistics show a clear trend.
status/ˈsteɪtəs/地位/He has a high social status.
steady/ˈstedi/稳定的/There has been a steady increase in sales.
stem/stem/茎；来源于/The problem stems from poor management.
stimulate/ˈstɪmjuleɪt/刺激/The policy will stimulate economic growth.
strategy/ˈstrætədʒi/策略/We need a new marketing strategy.
strengthen/ˈstreŋθən/加强/We should strengthen our cooperation.
stress/stres/压力；强调/She is under a lot of stress at work.
strict/strɪkt/严格的/The school has strict rules about uniforms.
strike/straɪk/罢工；打击/The workers went on strike for higher wages.
strive/straɪv/努力/She strives for excellence in everything she does.
structure/ˈstrʌktʃər/结构/The structure of the building is very strong.
submit/səbˈmɪt/提交/Please submit your report by Friday.
substance/ˈsʌbstəns/物质/Water is a colorless substance.
substantial/səbˈstænʃl/大量的/He made a substantial donation to the charity.
substitute/ˈsʌbstɪtuːt/替代品/Sugar is a poor substitute for honey.
subtle/ˈsʌtl/微妙的/There is a subtle difference between the two words.
succeed/səkˈsiːd/成功/She succeeded in passing the exam.
sufficient/səˈfɪʃnt/足够的/There is sufficient evidence to prove his guilt.
suggest/səˈdʒest/建议/I suggest we take a different approach.
suitable/ˈsuːtəbl/合适的/This movie is not suitable for children.
summarize/ˈsʌməraɪz/总结/Can you summarize the main points?
supplement/ˈsʌplɪmənt/补充/Vitamins are a good supplement to your diet.
supply/səˈplaɪ/供应/The supply of clean water is limited.
support/səˈpɔːrt/支持/She has the support of her family.
supreme/suːˈpriːm/最高的/The Supreme Court made the final decision.
surplus/ˈsɜːrpləs/剩余/The country has a trade surplus.
surround/səˈraʊnd/包围/The lake is surrounded by mountains.
survey/ˈsɜːrveɪ/调查/We conducted a survey on consumer habits.
survive/sərˈvaɪv/生存/Only a few species survived the disaster.
suspect/səˈspekt/怀疑/The police suspect him of theft.
suspend/səˈspend/暂停；悬挂/The company suspended operations during the crisis.
